     "titulo": "Warnings",
     "texto": [
      "**Vær forsiktig** means «be careful».",
      "**Glatt** describes a slippery surface. Unlike English adjectives, which never change, **vått** agrees with the neuter noun **gulv**: **et vått gulv**."
     ],
